# Beyond the Quiet: "Exile all creatures and Spacecraft." Bot1's Ornithopter, Bot2's Llanowar Elves and Bot2's Iron Shield
# Elf all go to exile, the Elf having discarded its Island in response to become indestructible: exile is not
# destruction, so indestructible does not help (CR 702.12b), and nothing dies, so no creature reaches a graveyard.
# Bot1's Smuggler's Copter is an uncrewed Vehicle, an artifact and no creature, and stays; so do the Moxen and lands.

